<00:00:01.043><c>the </c><00:00:01.044><c>family </c><00:00:01.045><c>of </c><00:00:01.046><c>beta  </c><00:00:01.047><c>distributions </c><00:00:01.048><c>the </c><00:00:01.049><c>posterior </c><00:00:01.050><c>will </c><00:00:01.051><c>also </c><00:00:01.052><c>be  </c><00:00:01.053><c>in </c><00:00:01.054><c>that </c><00:00:01.055><c>same </c><00:00:01.056><c>family </c><00:00:01.057><c>this </c><00:00:01.058><c>is </c><00:00:01.059><c>a </c><00:00:01.060><c>beautiful  </c><00:00:01.061><c>property </c><00:00:01.062><c>of </c><00:00:01.063><c>beta </c><00:00:01.064><c>distributions </c><00:00:01.065><c>that </c><00:00:01.066><c>can  </c><00:00:01.067><c>be </c><00:00:01.068><c>exploited </c><00:00:01.069><c>in </c><00:00:01.070><c>various </c><00:00:01.071><c>ways </c><00:00:01.072><c>one </c><00:00:01.073><c>of  </c><00:00:01.074><c>which </c><00:00:01.075><c>is </c><00:00:01.076><c>that </c><00:00:01.077><c>it </c><00:00:01.078><c>actually </c><00:00:01.079><c>allows </c><00:00:01.080><c>for  </c><00:00:01.081><c>recursive </c><00:00:01.082><c>ways </c><00:00:01.083><c>of </c><00:00:01.084><c>updating </c><00:00:01.085><c>the </c><00:00:01.086><c>posterior  </c><00:00:01.087><c>of </c><00:00:01.088><c>theta </c><00:00:01.089><c>as </c><00:00:01.090><c>we </c><00:00:01.091><c>get </c><00:00:01.092><c>more </c><00:00:01.093><c>and </c><00:00:01.094><c>more  </c><00:00:01.095><c>observations</c>

